Quoted materials, standards, regulatory texts, trademarks, product names, libraries and other third-party works remain under their own terms; this notice makes no ownership claim over them and does not override their licenses. Brand references do not imply endorsement or affiliation.

L'accès, la consultation et le fork disponibles via GitHub restent régis par les conditions de GitHub ; cette notice n'affirme pas les supprimer.

